 "goals": "<div class=\"ld-card ld-explain\"><h4>How your time is shared</h4><p>Each goal gets a share of activity time in proportion to its priority. First every goal reaches its weekly minimum, then deadline quests, then weekly targets, and extra volume only if your intensity setting allows it. No single goal may take more than 60% of the time while another is below its minimum.</p></div><div class=\"ld-card ld-goal\"><div class=\"ld-goal-h\"><div><h4>Build muscle</h4><small>Build Muscle · intermediate</small></div><select class=\"ld-sel\" data-act=\"goalPrio\" data-id=\"g-muscle\" aria-label=\"Priority\"><option value=\"5\">Top</option><option value=\"4\" selected=\"\">High</option><option value=\"3\">Medium</option><option value=\"2\">Light</option><option value=\"1\">Low</option></select></div><div class=\"ld-share\"><div><span>Target share</span><em><i style=\"width:44%\"></i></em><b>44%</b></div><div><span>Scheduled</span><em><i class=\"act\" style=\"width:57%\"></i></em><b>57%</b></div></div><p class=\"ld-muted\">7 sessions · 5h 45m this week · Resistance Training 2–3×, Meal Prep Batch 1×, Progress Check-in 1×</p><div class=\"ld-row\"><button class=\"ld-btn ld-small ld-ghost\" data-act=\"goalPause\" data-id=\"g-muscle\">Pause</button><button class=\"ld-btn ld-small ld-ghost\" data-act=\"goalDel\" data-id=\"g-muscle\">Remove</button></div></div><div class=\"ld-card ld-goal\"><div class=\"ld-goal-h\"><div><h4>Learn Spanish</h4><small>Learn a Language · novice</small></div><select class=\"ld-sel\" data-act=\"goalPrio\" data-id=\"g-spanish\" aria-label=\"Priority\"><option value=\"5\">Top</option><option value=\"4\">High</option><option value=\"3\" selected=\"\">Medium</option><option value=\"2\">Light</option><option value=\"1\">Low</option></select></div><div class=\"ld-share\"><div><span>Target share</span><em><i style=\"width:33%\"></i></em><b>33%</b></div><div><span>Scheduled</span><em><i class=\"act\" style=\"width:30%\"></i></em><b>30%</b></div></div><p class=\"ld-muted\">8 sessions · 3h this week · Vocab Review 4×, Grammar &amp; Drills 2×, Speaking &amp; Listening 1×, Weekly Skill Check 1×</p><div class=\"ld-row\"><button class=\"ld-btn ld-small ld-ghost\" data-act=\"goalPause\" data-id=\"g-spanish\">Pause</button><button class=\"ld-btn ld-small ld-ghost\" data-act=\"goalDel\" data-id=\"g-spanish\">Remove</button></div></div><div class=\"ld-card ld-goal\"><div class=\"ld-goal-h\"><div><h4>Read more</h4><small>Read More · novice</small></div><select class=\"ld-sel\" data-act=\"goalPrio\" data-id=\"g-read\" aria-label=\"Priority\"><option value=\"5\">Top</option><option value=\"4\">High</option><option value=\"3\">Medium</option><option value=\"2\" selected=\"\">Light</option><option value=\"1\">Low</option></select></div><div class=\"ld-share\"><div><span>Target share</span><em><i style=\"width:22%\"></i></em><b>22%</b></div><div><span>Scheduled</span><em><i class=\"act\" style=\"width:13%\"></i></em><b>13%</b></div></div><p class=\"ld-muted\">3 sessions · 1h 15m this week · Focused Reading 3×, Reading Checkpoint 0×</p><div class=\"ld-row\"><button class=\"ld-btn ld-small ld-ghost\" data-act=\"goalPause\" data-id=\"g-read\">Pause</button><button class=\"ld-btn ld-small ld-ghost\" data-act=\"goalDel\" data-id=\"g-read\">Remove</button></div></div><button class=\"ld-btn ld-primary ld-wide\" data-act=\"addGoal\">Add a goal</button>",
 "settings": "<div class=\"ld-card\"><h4>How much to schedule</h4><div class=\"ld-seg\"><button class=\"\" data-act=\"pref\" data-k=\"intensityLevel\" data-v=\"LIGHT\">Light</button><button class=\"on\" data-act=\"pref\" data-k=\"intensityLevel\" data-v=\"BALANCED\">Balanced</button><button class=\"\" data-act=\"pref\" data-k=\"intensityLevel\" data-v=\"AGGRESSIVE\">Ambitious</button><button class=\"\" data-act=\"pref\" data-k=\"intensityLevel\" data-v=\"HARDCORE\">All in</button></div><p class=\"ld-muted\">Light schedules only each goal’s weekly minimum. Ambitious and All in add extra sessions when time allows.</p><label class=\"ld-range\">Most activity time per day <b id=\"v-maxDailyGoalMinutes\">3h</b><input type=\"range\" min=\"30\" max=\"480\" step=\"15\" value=\"180\" data-act=\"prefRange\" data-k=\"maxDailyGoalMinutes\"><small>A hard daily ceiling, even on free days.</small></label><label class=\"ld-range\">Protected downtime per day <b id=\"v-minDailyRecoveryMinutes\">1h 30m</b><input type=\"range\" min=\"30\" max=\"360\" step=\"15\" value=\"90\" data-act=\"prefRange\" data-k=\"minDailyRecoveryMinutes\"><small>Kept clear before anything else is planned.</small></label><label class=\"ld-range\">Longest run of demanding work <b id=\"v-maxConsecutiveHighLoadMinutes\">1h 30m</b><input type=\"range\" min=\"30\" max=\"240\" step=\"15\" value=\"90\" data-act=\"prefRange\" data-k=\"maxConsecutiveHighLoadMinutes\"><small>After this, Life Director inserts something lighter.</small></label></div><div class=\"ld-card\"><h4>Rest days</h4><p class=\"ld-muted\">Hard workouts and heavy study are avoided on these days when possible.</p><div class=\"ld-dchips\"><button class=\"ld-dchip-btn\" data-act=\"restDay\" data-v=\"0\">Su</button><button class=\"ld-dchip-btn\" data-act=\"restDay\" data-v=\"1\">Mo</button><button class=\"ld-dchip-btn\" data-act=\"restDay\" data-v=\"2\">Tu</button><button class=\"ld-dchip-btn\" data-act=\"restDay\" data-v=\"3\">We</button><button class=\"ld-dchip-btn\" data-act=\"restDay\" data-v=\"4\">Th</button><button class=\"ld-dchip-btn\" data-act=\"restDay\" data-v=\"5\">Fr</button><button class=\"ld-dchip-btn\" data-act=\"restDay\" data-v=\"6\">Sa</button></div></div><div class=\"ld-card\"><h4>Planning window</h4><div class=\"ld-seg\"><button class=\"on\" data-act=\"pref\" data-k=\"planningHorizonDays\" data-v=\"7\">7 days</button><button class=\"\" data-act=\"pref\" data-k=\"planningHorizonDays\" data-v=\"14\">14 days</button></div></div><div class=\"ld-card\"><h4>When I miss something</h4><div class=\"ld-seg\"><button class=\"on\" data-act=\"pref\" data-k=\"consequenceMode\" data-v=\"LENIENT\">Gentle</button><button class=\"\" data-act=\"pref\" data-k=\"consequenceMode\" data-v=\"MODERATE\">Standard</button><button class=\"\" data-act=\"pref\" data-k=\"consequenceMode\" data-v=\"HARDCORE_RPG\">Hardcore</button></div><p class=\"ld-muted\">Gentle: no consequences, missed sessions are just re-planned. Standard: a rest token covers a miss; without one, that activity’s streak drops by one. Hardcore: also reports an HP penalty (never below 1 HP). At most one consequence per day, and never any XP or level loss. Rest tokens: <b>1</b> of 3 (earn one every 5 completions).</p><label class=\"ld-range\">Grace period before a session counts as missed <b>60m</b><input type=\"range\" min=\"15\" max=\"240\" step=\"15\" value=\"60\" data-act=\"prefRange\" data-k=\"missGraceMinutes\"></label></div><div class=\"ld-card\"><h4>Guide</h4><p class=\"ld-muted\">A short walkthrough of how to read each screen. It shows once on its own; you can replay it here or with the ? button at the top.</p><div class=\"ld-row\"><button class=\"ld-btn ld-small\" data-act=\"tourReset\">Show the guide again</button></div></div><div class=\"ld-card\"><h4>Your data</h4><p class=\"ld-muted\">Saved on this device under its own key, separate from your LifeMax save. </p><div class=\"ld-row\"><button class=\"ld-btn ld-small\" data-act=\"export\">Copy backup</button><button class=\"ld-btn ld-small\" data-act=\"import\">Restore backup</button><button class=\"ld-btn ld-small ld-danger\" data-act=\"reset\">Reset Life Director</button></div></div><details class=\"ld-card ld-details\"><summary>Diagnostics</summary><p class=\"ld-mono\">engine 1.1.0 · VALID_SCHEDULE · 0 ms · quality 94.9 · 38 planned · events 1 · host connected</p><label class=\"ld-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-act=\"labToggle\"> Show Simulation Lab (developer)</label></details>"
